# 印刷 (design 11.22), for tools/ui_run.py: the text open at the start
# (TADjsについて) printed. Ctrl+P (the menu letter of 書式's 印刷) opens
# 印刷設定; 画面表示 shows the sheets, goes to the next, is magnified and
# put away; 詳細設定 sets the printing paper to A4 across; 印刷 writes
# the PDF file and puts its link in the BTRON window.
click 600 450
wait 300
key 13 01
wait 1500
shot print_panel
# 画面表示: the first sheet, the next, magnified
click 658 511
wait 3000
shot print_preview
click 507 77
wait 2500
shot print_preview_next
click 635 77
wait 3000
shot print_preview_zoom
click 816 77
wait 1500
# 印刷詳細設定: A4用紙:横, the magnification 自動
click 543 511
wait 1500
shot print_detail
click 510 345
wait 300
click 862 549
wait 1500
shot print_panel_a4
# 印刷: the file written, its link on the desktop
click 862 511
expect print: 4 sheets
wait 1500
shot print_done
# 基本印刷: the link to the same text taken in the BTRON window, and 実行
# from its menu (opened with the right button, the item pressed): printed
# without being opened. 基本印刷 is in 実行 once it is one of the object's
# 機能付箋: the second row of the list, under 基本文章編集
apps 019a6c96-e262-7dfd-a3bc-1e85d495d60d basic-text-editor basic-print
click 60 90
wait 300
click 60 90 1
wait 800
move 70 310
wait 150
move 75 331
wait 600
move 150 331
wait 150
move 180 351
wait 300
shot print_basic_menu
click 180 351
wait 1500
shot print_basic_panel
logmark
key 28
expectsince print: 4 sheets
wait 1500
shot print_basic_done
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
